            <h1>What Is Body Fat Percentage? Healthy Ranges & How to Measure</h1>
            <p class="intro">Your weight doesn't tell the full story — your body fat percentage does. Here's what it means, what's healthy, and how to measure it at home.</p>
            <div class="a-info">
                <span>📅 Sep 24, 2026</span>
                <span>⏱️ 7 min read</span>
                <span>✍️ CalcFitly Team</span>
