            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-q">How can I measure body fat at home? <span>+</span></button>
                <div class="faq-a"><p>The easiest home methods are the US Navy tape-measure method (needs only a measuring tape), bioimpedance smart scales, and skinfold calipers. For a quick estimate, use a free online body fat calculator based on the Navy method.</p></div>
            </div>

